{{Factionpage|

| description = The Steel Warriors have two guildhalls, one in South [[Qeynos]] and one in West [[Freeport]].  Both are situated around PvP Areas, so care should be taken when visiting them.  In Freeport, Cain Darkmoore heads the guildhall called The Bunker.  In Qeynos Ebon Strongbear leads the warrior guildhall there.  The Steel warriors support the [[Knights of Truth]] in Freeport and the [[Guards of Qeynos]] in their fights against the corruption of [[The Freeport Militia]] and the [[Corrupt Qeynos Guards]].

